OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvercast
OL,6,Fwith rain spreading across the region
OL,7,Fduring the evening from the northwest.
OL,8,FThe rain, heavy at times, will turn
OL,9,Fpatchier towards dawn. Winds
OL,10,Fstrengthen and become blustery in
OL,11,Fplaces. Temperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FCloudy with further rain
OL,14,Finitially and into the afternoon with
OL,15,Fthe odd heavier burst possible.
OL,16,FTurning clearer later, with only
OL,17,Fisolated showers. Blustery winds with
OL,18,Ftemperatures just above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
